  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Cut the tomatoes in half. Trim the lettuce, then coarsely shred the leaves. Coarsely grate the cucumber.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2184520/photos/large/175656_1-c2b5d0c4b2f040e3b0451ccfbf00c162.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook mushroom meat: Thinly slice the mushroom meat. Heat 1½ tbs olive oil in a medium frypan over high heat. Cook the mushroom meat and Turkish seasoning, stirring, for 4-5 mins until browned and crisp. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2184521/photos/large/175656_2-018169f139af809bc71b6c9936a2c13f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salad: Combine 2 tsp olive oil and 2 tsp red wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the tomatoes and lettuce and toss to combine. Squeeze out the excess moisture from the grated cucumber. Combine the cucumber and yoghurt in a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2184522/photos/large/175656_3-a4d9eb556e2d4db3aa692404393c154c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Halve the pita to form 4 pockets. Put on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through. Spread the pita pockets with the cucumber yoghurt, then fill with the mushroom meat and some of the salad. Serve with the remaining salad and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2184523/photos/large/175656_4-9f9abb4974548e81895fd364769a06ac.jpeg"
    },
    {
